# bold-brand-studio — Vite + React Guard Rails

## Routing and structure

- React Router in `src/App.tsx`—add new routes **above** the catch-all `*` route.
- Pages live in `src/pages/`; shared UI in `src/components/` and `src/components/ui/` (shadcn).

## Data and integrations

- No backend in this repo; contact/forms use **EmailJS** (`@emailjs/browser`)—do not add Express or Next API routes here.
- TanStack Query is configured at the app root—use it for any future async client data; avoid ad-hoc `useEffect` fetch unless necessary.

## Styling

- Tailwind + `tailwind.config.ts`; extend existing tokens and component patterns.
- Do not replace global font/theme setup in `index.html` / root layout without confirmation.

## Quality

- Run `npm run lint` and `npm test` when changing non-trivial logic.
- Keep components focused; prefer colocating page-specific UI under `src/pages/` or `src/components/`.

## Boundaries

- This repo is independent of `crelyst` and `crelyst-backend`—do not import from sibling folders.
